Comprehensive Review: Book 3 - The Book of Mark
Verdict:This is the Tragedy of the Forking Path. Because the narrative stays in Universe A (where the ship sinks), this book functions as a heartbreaking origin story for the world we know, while subtly hinting at the world we lost.
Mark Antony becomes a tragic figure not just because of Cleopatra (later), but because a single moment of vanity with a mirror cost humanity 2,000 years of technological advancement.
