	•	The Burden: In Universe A, he survives the wreck (on the Crocodile Rock). He goes on to become a great general, but perhaps he is haunted by a "phantom memory" of the other life—the one where he returned to Rome as a hero with the Mechanism. This Déjà Vu (as established in Book 0) explains his erratic behavior in later historical records.
3. The Mechanics of the Split
	•	The Mirror: This object becomes a legendary artifact in its own right.
	◦	The Physics: It ties into the "Observer Effect." Mark observing himself (vanity) collapses the wave function in a specific way.
