Critique on "Universe B" Chapter Listings
	•	Issue: Your synopsis lists "Chapter 10: Aftermath in Universe B."
	•	Adjustment: If Universe B comes after 1982 (in Book 4), you should remove Chapter 10 and 11B from this specific book.
