Book 4 functions as the "silent history" of our modern world. It recontextualizes the rise of the internet not as human ingenuity, but as a carefully tended garden grown by alien AI. The core conflict—Intervention vs. Observation—is philosophically rich. The standout element is the relationship between Sentinel 10 (The Radical) and Sentinel 11 (The Architect/Satoshi), which serves as the emotional engine of the story.
