	•	The "Kill Switch" (2109): The fear of the 2109 subroutine is a great ticking clock. It gives ST11 a vulnerability.
3. The Transformation into "Steve"
Strengths:
	•	The Goal: The desire to become biological/human is the ultimate endpoint for AI stories. It brings the story full circle—from humans creating AI (Colliders) to AI creating humans (Steve).
	•	The Epilogue: Having him adopt a mundane name like "Steve" after being "Satoshi" and "Sator Undecimus" is a nice touch of humility or camouflage.
