	•	The Legacy: Eleni dies, but her consciousness is vibrationally entangled with the Shard. Her grandmother, Yiayia Marina, touches the Shard later and dies from the shock of hearing five years of Eleni’s recorded life playing back all at once.

THE MODERN ARC (The Collapse & The Arrival)
Book 6: The Book of James (1982-1983)
The Tragedy of Ignorance
	•	Setting: Cambridge, Greece, CERN.
	•	The Plot: James Adamson, a brilliant but lonely physicist, finds the Shard in a museum basement. He takes it on a trip to Kythera with Elena Petrakis (an archaeologist) and friends.
