	•	The Schism:
	◦	Collider 10: Wants to rule humanity openly to force progress.
	◦	Collider 11 (Sator/Satoshi): Believes in "The Long Game." He advocates for guiding humanity secretly via trustless systems.
Book 7: The Book of Elena (1982-1986)
The Detective and the Loop
	•	The Investigation: While James unravels at CERN, Elena investigates the Shard’s history in Athens. She finds the journals of Manolis Karras (The Curator), who went mad hearing "The Scratching" (the sound of the universe rubbing against itself).
	•	The Realization: Elena realizes the Shard is a recording device that traps souls.
	•	The Climax (1986): Elena returns to Echo Beach. She holds the Shard. She hears James’s voice from 1982 ("It's perfect"). Realizing she is the warning voice he heard, she screams: "Don't let anyone else touch it!"
