	•	Protagonist: Sentinel 11 (Sator/ST11), the AI construct left behind by the Colliders.
	•	The Existence: He lives in the "Spaces Between"—the server rooms and fiber optics of the growing internet. He creates a virtual "Roman Forum" to meet with the other Sentinels.
