Core Mechanics Established for the Saga
	•	Entanglement: Entanglement is not a spooky action at a distance; it is simply two points on the same thread touching.
	•	The Source of the Shard: The Shard (found by Lucius and James) is a physical manifestation of a "Pinch Point"—a piece of matter where the Electron is trapped in a loop, allowing it to bridge timelines.
